1795198400002075	codex	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-3ql	{"field":"description","value":"Give callers a worked conversion for a reference with spaces/punctuation and one missing a start time. Preserve the written reference in approval.reference. Specify the namespace and stable inputs used to derive a valid ID, with collision handling for distinct approvals and stability across edits to the same approval. Request the actual approval time when needed; a guessed start can grant time outside the written window.\n\nAccept with tested examples of a long reference, identical reference strings from different owners and a revision retaining its ID. An approval lacking enough evidence for a start remains incomplete. Put the recipe and ID/ledger consequences in docs/INTEGRATING.md, without changing pass format 1."}	blake3:qW5ERU-QlH08qHxTUSL8aVdK2d92Y-TLkvUNxXNMh8c
