1795198400242286	codex	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-2qt	{"field":"description","value":"Document a caller recipe for separately approved practice runs. Allocate a fresh collision-resistant ID per start, keep the reusable owner's reference as metadata, and require a new explicit window and ceilings for each run. Limit this recipe to loopback practice and keep the ledger/witness in the normal locations. A restarted process in the same run must reuse its ID. Leave routed rehearsals under normal written approvals.\n\nAccept with two runs starting within one second and a restart of the first. A spend in run A survives its restart, run B has its own budget, and copying A without its ledger still refuses against the same state directory. Demonstrate with temporary files/CLI and update docs/INTEGRATING.md. This resolves the bench use case without adding a reset flag or a special ledger format."}	blake3:1kF7kCEuHPRU3F_e3zwpjTZ0WaeNUsrOqIrlBntjN10
