1795198400707810	codex	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-3z6	{"field":"description","value":"Add a bounded ordered target list to read-only permits and to spend. Give each named target an unambiguous name association; reject ambiguous repeated --to/--name combinations before touching state. Retain existing single-target forms and single-target JSON fields. Reuse the pinned path when available and the existing pure matcher per target. A spend checks all targets on one locked pass revision and consumes one debit only after all allow.\n\nAccept when one denied target among several produces its index and refusal, no recorded debit, and a success charges once and identifies the matched destinations in input order. Include mixed named and unnamed targets, invalid input, changed digest and backward compatibility for callers passing one target. A Rust/CLI fixture in tests/integrating.rs demonstrates the same unit decision and accounting. Document the CLI grammar, bound and JSON shape in docs/spec.md."}	blake3:-XntjngX6Dx6E2i642b1ev2TEmTo76aB4j0fml2Kk3U
