1795198400933651	codex	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-1na	{"field":"description","value":"Expose spend --dry-run and a Rust read-only operation using the same pure decision and request validation as a real spend. Check pass digest, window, named target, counter, verified balances and witness state. Distinguish would-allow from a committed allowed response. Refuse unusable state when it is detectable through read-only inspection. Describe disk space, future lock acquisition and actual write success as unknowable in a preview.\n\nAccept with paired preview/spend tests on equivalent isolated snapshots: same policy refusal/code or projected totals, including zero/absent ledger, exhausted budget, changed digest and a divergent or unreadable witness. Neither a fresh preview nor a refusal creates directories, lock files, ledger headers or witnesses. Cover the race in which another process spends the last unit between preview and commit. Document JSON and the need for a real spend at the point of use. Extend parity tests to new request shapes when those land."}	blake3:qytKghM3mttR5b6lYWSwL8bfoup4UHRfumldO8Sr7Rs
